recover ChildVault CCIP send on Base fork
├── when the Base child epoch withdraw CCIP send fails
│   ├── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryStored
│   ├── it should retry the send and route USDC to Arbitrum
│   └── it should make the parent epoch claimable for USDC
└── when the Base child rebalance CCIP send fails
    ├── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryStored
    ├── it should retry the send and route USDC to Arbitrum
    └── it should clear the Base active adapter and finalize the parent rebalance
